<title>UK: Ldn gold closes firmer on short-covering bounce.</title>
<headline>Ldn gold closes firmer on short-covering bounce.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closes firmer at $321.70/$322.20, versus $318.30/$318.80 on Monday after light fund short-covering. Meeting resistance around $322.00. But sentiment still very bearish.</p>
<p>SILVER - Finishes nine cents lower at $4.35/$4.37. Bounces after fixing at near four-year low of $4.25.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Closes at $408.00/$412.00, down $2.50.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Ends at $174.00/$178.00, down $7.70.</p>
</text>
